Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:26:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] d/pimax_p3c: 1-Euro still smoothing for controllers and HMD

Adds a clean-room adaptive 1-Euro pose filter (position + SLERP quaternion)
with timestamp deduplication so grip and aim queries on the same frame never
double-filter, and automatic reset across gaps >250 ms.

Live settings (applied without restart):
- PIMAX_CTRL_SMOOTHING: gentle (default), strong, or off
- PIMAX_HMD_SMOOTHING:  off (default) or gentle
